# Optional. When both are set at build time, the dashboard reads published
# runs from this Supabase project (anon / publishable key only — never
# service_role). If either is unset, the UI falls back to ./data JSON
# (npm run sync / build / preview) or, in `npm run dev`, results/dfperf.db.
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
